# Data Source

## Dataset

This project uses the **Wine Tasting Dataset** provided by **Maven Analytics Data Playground**.

The dataset was used to build an interactive Power BI dashboard for analyzing global wine trends, pricing, ratings, wineries, and reviewer activity.

## Dataset Information

- Total Wine Reviews: 120,913
- Countries Covered: 42
- Wineries: 15,820
- Wine Varieties: 692
- Fields Used:
  - Country
  - Province
  - Winery
  - Variety
  - Price
  - Rating (Points)
  - Designation
  - Title
  - Taster Name
  - Description

## Dataset Source

https://mavenanalytics.io/data-playground/wine-tasting

## Note

The dataset is not included in this repository due to file size limitations. It can be downloaded directly from the Maven Analytics Data Playground using the link above.

---

**Source:** Maven Analytics – Wine Tasting Data Playground
